AmareloTDS
==========

AmareloTDS is a derivative work based on YellowTDS by Yehor Dvygolov (GitHub: dvygolov).
Upstream project: https://github.com/dvygolov/YellowTDS

The traffic-distribution engine (per-request white/black/trafficback routing, the SQLite
data model, the admin panel, filtering, A/B testing, HTML processing, and macros) originates
from the upstream author's work. This project builds on that base — notably the `ytds`
command-line client, the admin JSON API, and extensions to campaign/library operations — and
rebrands the product as AmareloTDS.

The upstream project is published without an explicit software license. This NOTICE exists to
acknowledge its authorship. The LICENSE file in this repository covers only the original
contributions authored by the AmareloTDS project (see LICENSE for the exact scope). Nothing in
this repository asserts ownership over the upstream author's code.
